{"title": "Orb of Darkvision", "pageid": 48819, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Orb_of_Darkvision", "categories": ["Misc items", "Common items", "Environmental objects"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Item_DEC_Dungeon_SharTemple_Orb_A_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Item_DEC_Dungeon_SharTemple_Orb_A_Faded.png/300px-Item_DEC_Dungeon_SharTemple_Orb_A_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/3/31/Item_DEC_Dungeon_SharTemple_Orb_A_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Orb of Darkvision image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Item_DEC_Dungeon_SharTemple_Orb_A_Faded.png/300px-Item_DEC_Dungeon_SharTemple_Orb_A_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Item_DEC_Dungeon_SharTemple_Orb_A_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <b>Orb of Darkvision</b> is a unique miscellanous item. It can be found in <a href=\"/wiki/Grymforge\" title=\"Grymforge\">Grymforge</a>, near the beginning of a trapped gallery available after completing a side quest <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Get_Past_the_Rubble\" title=\"Get Past the Rubble\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Get Past the Rubble\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Get_Past_the_Rubble\" title=\"Get Past the Rubble\">Get Past the Rubble</a>.\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<ul><li>When used, the Orb of Darkvision casts <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision\" title=\"Darkvision\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/25px-Darkvision_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/38px-Darkvision_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/50px-Darkvision_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Darkvision\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/25px-Darkvision_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision\" title=\"Darkvision\">Darkvision</a> for 10 turns on the party member who activated it. It can be used multiple times by different party members, as well as by the same party member again.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Grymforge\" title=\"Grymforge\">Grymforge</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-635&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;432</span>\n</p>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The Orb of Darkvision is clearly a contraption designed by followers of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shar\" title=\"Shar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp/20px-Shar_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp/30px-Shar_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp/40px-Shar_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shar\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp/20px-Shar_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shar\" title=\"Shar\">Shar</a>. However, it is unclear if it ever had any other purpose apart from described effect.</li>\n<li>Though it is an active element of the environment, the Orb cannot be examined and has no options other than \"Use\".</li>\n<li>Upon using it, any character, including the player character, utters a phrase describing their feelings, mostly mentioning emptiness or a sense of loss inside. The only exception is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/38px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/50px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadowheart\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\">Shadowheart</a>, who recognizes the effect as the sign of presence of her goddess.</li>\n<li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Two\" title=\"Act Two\">Act Two</a>, an immobile object called \"Umbral Gem\" near the statue of Shar at the entrance to the <a href=\"/wiki/Gauntlet_of_Shar\" title=\"Gauntlet of Shar\">Gauntlet of Shar</a> is visually a copy of the Orb of Darkvision. Likewise, it has the only option to \"use\" it, though its function is different.</li>\n<li>This effect overwrites the spell Darkvision, which lasts until long rest, so after the 10 turns the character no longer has Darkvision from either source.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202257\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1537/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 13703/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6973/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 24/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 818164/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   36.167      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   36.167      1 -total\n 50.72%   18.343      6 Template:Icon_text\n 49.21%   17.797      1 Template:PageSeo\n 49.10%   17.759      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 48.69%   17.611      5 Template:Icon_link\n 42.19%   15.261     12 Template:Trim\n 32.66%   11.814      1 Template:Quest\n 30.21%   10.926      6 Template:Ifempty\n  8.65%    3.127      3 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:48819-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202257 and revision id 394852. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}